{"ticker":{"symbol":"AAOI","name":"Applied Optoelectronics, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":115.59,"change_pct":0.07705926202012692,"market_cap":9814317056.0,"pe":25.117338,"pb":5.847625,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":18.5,"week52_high":233.67,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"United States","city":"Sugar Land","employees":4691,"website":"https://www.ao-inc.com","business_summary":"Applied Optoelectronics, Inc. engages in the design, manufacture, and sale of fiber-optic networking products in the United States, Taiwan, and China. The company offers optical modules, optical filters, lasers, laser components, subassemblies, transmitters and transceivers, turn-key equipment, headend, node, and distribution equipment, as well as amplifiers. It sells its products to internet data center operators, cable television, telecom equipment manufacturers, fiber-to-the-home, and internet service providers through its direct and indirect sales channels. Applied Optoelectronics, Inc. was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Sugar Land, Texas.","business_summary_ko":"Applied Optoelectronics, Inc.는 미국, 대만 및 중국에서 광섬유 네트워킹 제품의 설계, 제조 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 광학 모듈, 광학 필터, 레이저, 레이저 부품, 하위 어셈블리, 송신기 및 송수신기, 턴키 장비, 헤드엔드, 노드, 분배 장비, 증폭기를 제공합니다. 직간접 판매 채널을 통해 인터넷 데이터 센터 운영자, 케이블 TV, 통신 장비 제조업체, FTTH(Fiber-to-The-Home) 및 인터넷 서비스 제공업체에 제품을 판매합니다. Applied Optoelectronics, Inc.는 1997년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 슈거랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","industry_ko":"통신장비","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":222818000.0,"operating_income":-58838000.0,"net_income":-66397000.0,"eps":-2.38},{"period":"2023","revenue":217646000.0,"operating_income":-40412000.0,"net_income":-56048000.0,"eps":-1.75},{"period":"2024","revenue":249365000.0,"operating_income":-70513000.0,"net_income":-186733000.0,"eps":-4.5},{"period":"2025","revenue":455715000.0,"operating_income":-49736000.0,"net_income":-38228000.0,"eps":-0.64}],"price_history":[],"analyst":{"n_analysts":5,"